<title>ZIMBABWE: Five Zimbabweans killed in road crash.</title>
<headline>Five Zimbabweans killed in road crash.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five Zimbabweans were killed and several injured when two vehicles collided on the outskirts of the capital Harare, state radio reported on Saturday.</p>
<p>A police spokesman told the radio the accident occurred when a commuter omnibus tried to overtake a taxi in a misty area in the early morning.</p>
